"""Write evidence-linked research drafts from the audited saved-output summary."""
import csv,json,pathlib
HERE=pathlib.Path(__file__).resolve().parent;OUT=HERE/'report';ROOT=HERE.parents[2]
def pct(x):return f'{100*x:.2f}%'
def main():
    data=json.loads((OUT/'summary.json').read_text());assert data['validation']['primary200_complete']
    primary=[r for r in data['selection'] if r['scope']=='primary200_seed42'];full={r['method']:r for r in primary if r['size']==6006}
    lines=['# Proposal gap closure: measured local primary results','',
      'Research draft. The complete primary grid contains200 exposed official queries × five methods × four catalog sizes =4000 planned cases. Additional24-query seed/model sensitivity,12 generated probes and full4392-query retrieval are separate stages. Their status follows execution receipts; they are not pooled into this primary analysis.','',
      '## Findings','',
      f"At6006 skills, BM25 retrieved {pct(full['bm25']['retrieval_recall5'])} of positive qrels in its topfive and the selector exactly matched9/200 sets. Vector retrieved {pct(full['vector']['retrieval_recall5'])} with7/200 exact sets. Hybrid retrieved {pct(full['hybrid']['retrieval_recall5'])} with11/200 exact sets. Domain vector returned4/200 exact sets. These are outcomes of a small constrained0.6B deployment, not skill execution or native SkillsMiddleware results.",
      '',f"Full listing required a mean{full['listing']['tokenized_logical_input_mean_including_preflight']:,.0f} locally tokenized prompt tokens at6006 skills and all200 cases failed the configured8192-token preflight. At100 skills,196 valid listing outputs produced zero exact sets, so context fit alone did not establish correct selection. The tokenized preflight length is not model-consumed usage.",'',
      'The predeclared hybrid-minus-BM25 difference at6006 is about+1.02 percentage points. Its paired stratified95% interval spans zero. The supplied proposal supports an accuracy/efficiency trade-off question, not a predetermined winner. Nominal family-adjusted intervals are also reported; no universal superiority claim follows from this exposed sample.','',
      '## Primary method-size table','',
      '|N|Method|Planned|Valid|Exact sets|Prevalence-weighted exact|Macro Recall@5|MRR@5|',
      '|---:|---|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|---:|']
    for r in primary:
        recall='unranked' if r['retrieval_recall5'] is None else f"{r['retrieval_recall5']:.4f}"
        mrr='unranked' if r['retrieval_mrr5'] is None else f"{r['retrieval_mrr5']:.4f}"
        lines.append(f"|{r['size']}|{r['method']}|{r['planned']}|{r['valid']}|{r['exact_successes']}|{pct(r['official_prevalence_weighted_exact'])}|{recall}|{mrr}|")
    lines += ['', 'Exact estimates use official1/2/3-positive prevalence weights2143/4392,1703/4392,546/4392. Raw counts retain the sample denominator200. Retrieval measures are sample-macro means with stage failures scored zero; conditional observed measures and their counts remain in CSV. Listing has full-library coverage1 by construction and no semantic Recall@5.','',
      '## Efficiency and resources','',
      'Input/output tokens include each fresh routing stage. Preflight counts, returned model-evaluation counts and unknown failed usage have distinct meanings. Report successful latency separately from failure latency. Relative latency uses paired valid cases with BM25 plus the same selector at the same size and implementation; early implementation timing is retained but excluded from the corrected comparison. Startup/indexing are separate.','',
      'The local machine provides an RTX2060SUPER with8GB VRAM and16GB host RAM. Existing WSL settings cap the guest at6GB and two virtual CPUs with2GB swap. Those settings were read, never changed. Work uses one GPU job at a time and a CPU encoder. The official BGE ONNX export passed a non-evaluation PyTorch CPU parity test with maximum absolute difference1.23e-7. CPU/CUDA setup interruptions, RAM guards and a result-append failure remain in receipts. A single generated-case outcome is unavailable after the append error and is not retried. No primary prediction was lost.','',
      '## Evidence and reproducibility','',
      '- [Frozen protocol](../protocol.json), [specification](../SPEC.md), [exact catalogs](../catalogs.json.gz) and [model provenance](../model-provenance.json).',
      '- [Selection CSV](selection-summary.csv), [strata](strata.csv), [paired uncertainty](paired-primary.csv), [error taxonomy](error-taxonomy.csv), [domain diagnostics](domain-diagnostics.csv) and [independent validation](validation.json).',
      '- [Measurement corrections](../MEASUREMENT_CORRECTIONS.md), [implementation corrections](../IMPLEMENTATION_CORRECTIONS.md) and raw/source snapshots in the study folder.',
      '- Figures: [selection heatmap](selection-heatmap.png), [token growth](input-growth.png), [latency](latency.png), [candidate recall](candidate-recall.png) and [paired differences](paired-differences.png).','',
      '## Scope and remaining evidence','',
      'The supplied four-page proposal remains the primary historical target; the revised LaTeX proposal is a separate version. The original80 model-method-size cells have explicit statuses. Local Qwen does not complete unrun hosted cells. All4392 public test queries are exposed; this200-query frozen sample is not a fresh holdout. Qrels may omit plausible alternatives. Metadata views, pools and panels differ across historical studies, which remain supporting evidence only.','',
      'The balanced24-query sensitivity must be reported separately from the primary prevalence estimate. Two local model configurations differ in architecture, training and quantization as well as parameter count; they are not a clean causal size experiment. Generated compositional labels are silver unions, not human adjudication or proof of dependency semantics. Sequence ordering, actual activation/execution, independently authored requests and two-person agreement remain pending. No human label or contribution is invented.','',
      'Hosted follow-up is separately versioned under [hosted/](../hosted/README.md), including its frozen shared panel, exact model/provider pins, physical API ledger, known charges and unknown liability holds. The user authorized US$2 total across models and 600 generation attempts. See the current saved execution receipt and results; the earlier four-size DeepSeek planning files are superseded preparation, not completed evidence. Hosted and local panels/output contracts are not pooled.','',
      '## Draft authorship and review','',
      'Permitted team aliases:deepujoy88,speccy88,vsimard. This AI-assisted engineering and research draft requires team review. Individual contributions and final course submission approval remain for the team to confirm.']
    (OUT/'RESEARCH_DRAFT.md').write_text('\n'.join(lines)+'\n')
    # Source-only NeurIPS draft. Figures and tabular values are generated from saved outputs.
    tex=[r'\documentclass{article}',r'\usepackage[preprint]{neurips_2026}',r'\usepackage{booktabs,graphicx,hyperref}',r'\title{Agent Skill Discovery at Scale: Matched Local Evidence}',r'\author{\texttt{deepujoy88}\And\texttt{speccy88}\And\texttt{vsimard}}',r'\begin{document}\maketitle',r'\begin{abstract}Research draft. We compare five discovery strategies on200 exposed public SkillRet queries at four catalog sizes. Retrieval coverage and final set agreement are distinct. At6006 skills, hybrid retrieves57.17\% of positive qrels at five candidates but produces11 exact sets out of200; BM25 produces9. The paired difference is uncertain. Full listing exceeds the configured8192-token budget at1000 and6006 skills. Results concern a constrained0.6B metadata selector, not task execution.\end{abstract}',r'\section{Question and scope}We evaluate the supplied proposal\textquotesingle s accuracy and efficiency question while preserving its iterative-scope disclaimer. The original80 hosted cells remain separately tracked. Historical studies use different panels and views and are not pooled.',r'\section{Method}We freeze200 exposed queries with98/78/24 one/two/three-positive strata and seed42. Per-query gold-conditioned catalogs contain10,100,1000,6006 skills. BM25 uses local IDF,k1=1.5,b=0.75; vector search uses pinned BGE-small CLS-normalized embeddings; hybrid uses equal RRF60. Domain vector routes with the same selector and no global fallback. Full listing exposes all metadata. Strict opaque-ID JSON selection returns zero to five IDs and offers no tools.',r'\section{Results}\input{../experiments/benchmarks/skillret-gap-closure-20261024/report/primary-table.tex}',r'\begin{figure}[t]\centering\includegraphics[width=\linewidth]{../experiments/benchmarks/skillret-gap-closure-20261024/report/selection-heatmap.png}\caption{All-planned exact-set agreement. Counts retain200 queries per cell.}\end{figure}',r'\section{Analysis and uncertainty}The primary estimate weights strata by official prevalence. Paired query bootstrap resamples within strata using2000 fixed-seed replicates. Primary contrasts are hybrid minus BM25 and domain vector minus vector at each size. Report nominal95\% and family-adjusted percentile intervals. At6006, hybrid minus BM25 is+1.02 percentage points with a95\% interval spanning zero. More context does not guarantee correct selection: at100 skills,196 valid listing outputs produced zero exact sets.',r'\section{Measurement and limitations}Preserve RAM stops, context exclusions, malformed outputs, unknown usage and persistence failures. Early domain timing scored the whole catalog before filtering; corrected timing uses the routed subset and matched implementation cohorts. All public queries were previously exposed. Positive qrels may be incomplete. Generated probes use silver unions without human adjudication. Balanced24-query model/seed sensitivity remains separate. Two deployments vary architecture/training/quantization, so differences are not purely model-size effects. Ordering, fresh human requests and task execution remain unevaluated.',r'\section{Conclusion}This bounded local experiment distinguishes candidate coverage, final selection and operational feasibility. It supports reproducible comparison and explicit limits rather than a universal method ranking.',r'\section*{Contributions and AI assistance}Team aliases are preserved. Contributions await team confirmation. This AI-assisted research draft requires human review; no completed human adjudication is claimed.',r'\end{document}']
    hosted_addendum=HERE/'hosted/reports/paper-addendum.tex'
    if hosted_addendum.exists():tex.insert(-1,hosted_addendum.read_text())
    (ROOT/'paper/final_report.tex').write_text('\n'.join(tex)+'\n')
    table=[r'\begin{table}[t]\centering\small',r'\begin{tabular}{lrrr}\toprule Method & Exact/200 & Recall@5 & MRR@5\\\midrule']
    for method in ['bm25','vector','domain_vector','hybrid']:
        r=full[method];label=method.replace('_',r'\_');table.append(f"{label} & {r['exact_successes']} & {r['retrieval_recall5']:.3f} & {r['retrieval_mrr5']:.3f}"+r'\\')
    table += [r'\bottomrule\end{tabular}\caption{Primary200-query sample at6006 skills. Sample-macro retrieval and raw exact counts.}\end{table}']
    (OUT/'primary-table.tex').write_text('\n'.join(table)+'\n')
    slides=['# Research presentation draft','', '##1. Discovery question','Five methods, four catalog sizes, one common selector. Separate retrieval coverage from final selected sets.','', '##2. Frozen primary design','200 exposed queries. Seed42. Original size grid. Pinned metadata and model hashes. Gold-conditioned small catalogs.','', '##3. Existing evidence and scope drift','Historical16 studies remain separate. Original/revised proposals and80 hosted cells have a versioned crosswalk.','', '##4. Measured selection','Use report/selection-heatmap.png and retain planned/valid denominators.','', '##5. Retrieval versus selection','At6006, hybrid Recall@5 is57.17% while exact sets are11/200. BM25 yields9/200. This tests a weak0.6B deployment.','', '##6. Context and latency','Use input-growth.png and latency.png. Distinguish preflight tokens, successful serving, startup and failure latency.','', '##7. Paired uncertainty','Use paired-differences.png. The full-catalog hybrid difference has an interval spanning zero.','', '##8. Scenario and model sensitivity','Keep balanced24-query and generated12-probe results separate. Show actual execution status; do not invent pending values.','', '##9. Limitations','Exposed synthetic queries, incomplete qrels, small sensitivity panel, no human adjudication or ordering/execution success.','', '##10. Reproduction and next evidence','Source snapshots, raw ledgers, tests and regeneration commands. Hosted stage obeys explicit caps and credential availability. Team roles and speaking allocation await confirmation.']
    hosted_slides=HERE/'hosted/reports/presentation-addendum.md'
    if hosted_slides.exists():slides+=['',hosted_slides.read_text()]
    folder=ROOT/'paper/presentation';folder.mkdir(exist_ok=True);(folder/'research_draft.md').write_text('\n'.join(slides)+'\n')
    print('Research draft, NeurIPS source, generated table and presentation outline written from saved summary')
if __name__=='__main__':
    main()
    from enrich_report import main as enrich
    enrich()
